    "definition": "reverseBuf (from ../cascade/cascade_lib.js, reused verbatim): CODEPOINT reversal when the buffer decodes as valid UTF-8 under a fatal TextDecoder; otherwise RAW BYTE reversal. It is applied identically at every optional reverse boundary in this sweep.",
    "notGloballyBijective": true,
    "witness": {
